[BriefingSubmissions.STORM.attack_prk.assault_usa.Mission.Objectives]
Capture the bridge, and press deeper into enemy territory, attacking the military base marked on the map.

[BriefingSubmissions.STORM.attack_prk.assault_usa.Mission.Description]
You must cross the river to continue the attack. Destroy the enemy's heavy defenses near the bridge and the nearby inhabited locality, and capture the bridge. Then advance deeper into enemy territory and overrun the enemy military base, where you can consolidate your forces.

